<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:50%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span><span id="S4.F4.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qualitative comparison of images generated by models trained on StockMix.</span>
<span id="S4.F4.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">VUGEN</span> demonstrates significantly stronger prompt following capabilities (<em id="S4.F4.14" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">e.g</em>.<span id="S4.F4.15" class="ltx_text"></span> rainbow in column 1, umbrella and bench in column 2, fruit in column 3) and produces more realistic outputs as well as finer visual details (columns 4, 5 and 6).</figcaption>
</figure>
