<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>
Comparison with SOTA unified VLMs on image generation metrics. For <span id="S4.T2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">VUGEN</span>, we report metrics both at a fixed default guidance scale of 5 and at their respective optimal guidance scales, since fidelity and prompt alignment metrics peak at different values. We found the optimal guidance scale to be 1.5 for FID, 12 for GenEval, and 14 for DGP Score.
</figcaption>
</figure>
